Result:
{"blocking_findings":["Visual styling is broken due to the removal of the `active` class from the filter buttons in `Footer.tsx` without updating the corresponding CSS selector in `App.css`. The selector `.filters button.active` (line 47) must be replaced with `.filters button[aria-pressed=\"true\"]` to restore the visual appearance of the selected button. This violates acceptance criterion #2, which requires the visual appearance to remain unchanged."],"criteria_results":[{"criterion":"Each filter button (`all`, `active`, `completed`) includes an `aria-pressed` attribute that is `true` for the active filter and `false` for the others.","evidence":"The diff shows `aria-pressed={option === filter}` was added to the buttons in `Footer.tsx`.","pass":true},{"criterion":"The visual appearance of the selected button remains unchanged.","evidence":"The CSS selector `.filters button.active` in `App.css` is still present, but the `active` class is no longer applied to the buttons. This breaks the visual styling for the selected button.","pass":false},{"criterion":"A screen reader announces the selected state of each button.","evidence":"The `aria-pressed` attribute is correctly implemented, but this cannot be verified without a screen reader test. Assumed to pass pending manual testing.","pass":true},{"criterion":"The `active` class is no longer used for styling the selected button.","evidence":"The `active` class was removed from the button elements in `Footer.tsx`.","pass":true},{"criterion":"The functionality of the buttons remains unchanged.","evidence":"The `onClick` handler and button logic are untouched in the diff.","pass":true}],"suggestions":["Update the CSS selector in `App.css` from `.filters button.active` to `.filters button[aria-pressed=\"true\"]` to restore the visual styling.","Manually test the buttons with a screen reader to confirm the selected state is announced correctly."],"summary":"The implementation correctly adds `aria-pressed` to the filter buttons and removes the `active` class, but it fails to update the CSS selector to target `[aria-pressed=\"true\"]`. This breaks the visual appearance of the selected button, violating the acceptance criteria. The change must be updated to restore the visual styling before shipping.","verdict":"request_changes"}
